        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Enable or disable link layer event info reporting. This command passes the parameters directly to the vendor-specific HCI command HCI_VS_Siliconlabs_Event_Info_Reporting_Enable. This command is only available if the bluetooth_feature_event_info_reporting component is included in the application. See the documentation of the HCI command for detailed description of each parameter and the behavior of the command.</para>
<para>Events that have been succesfully enabled will be reported with the <ref refid="group__sl__bt__evt__linklayer__event__info__report" kindref="compound">sl_bt_evt_linklayer_event_info_report</ref> event.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">enable</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Enable or disable event info reporting. Values:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>0:</bold> Disable event info reporting</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>1:</bold> Enable event info reporting </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">configuration</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Bitmask to specify the event info reporting configuration. See the link layer documentation of HCI_VS_Siliconlabs_Event_Info_Reporting_Enable for detailed description of each bit. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">procedure_type</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the procedure that this configuration is for. See the link layer documentation of HCI_VS_Siliconlabs_Event_Info_Reporting_Enable for detailed description of available procedure types. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">procedure_identifier_len</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Length of data in <computeroutput>procedure_identifier</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">procedure_identifier</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The identifier of the procedure that this configuration is for. See the link layer documentation of HCI_VS_Siliconlabs_Event_Info_Reporting_Enable for detailed description of procedure identifiers.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>SL_STATUS_OK if successful. Error code otherwise.</para>
</simplesect>
<bold>Events</bold> <itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__sl__bt__evt__linklayer__event__info__report" kindref="compound">sl_bt_evt_linklayer_event_info_report</ref> - Sent for each event info report received from the link layer. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
